        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 227, Modern Door Lever Latchset with Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis new modern door lever set from Omnia features a round rose combined with a very sleek lever. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting (installation screws are hidden),  for a very clean, modern look. It fits standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door preparation. Easy to install, the Modern Door Lever with Round Rose made by Omnia will fit 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\" or 2\" door thicknesses with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. It is available in polished chrome, satin chrome, satin nickel, and oil-rubbed bronze finishes as either a passage, privacy, or dummy function. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: <a href=\"/products/modern-door-lever-with-square-rose-omnia-227s-00\"><b>Modern 227 Omnia Lever with Square Rose</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Door Lever Latchset with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 227 Modern Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/lcn-4110.jpg?v=1704442264\" width=\"342\" height=\"138\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Door Lever with Round Rose",
                "description": "Omnia 227/00 Modern Door Lever Set - This new modern door lever set from Omnia features a round rose combined with a very sleek lever. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting (installation screws are hidden),  for a very clean, modern look.  It fits standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door preparation. Easy to install, this leverset made by Omnia will fit 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch or 2 inch door thicknesses with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It is available in polished chrome, satin chrome, satin nickel, and oil-rubbed bronze finishes as either a passage, privacy, or dummy function. ",
                "keywords": "Omnia 227 Lever Latchsets, omn-227/00, modern door levers, Omnia Modern Door Lever Sets, contemporary door levers, sleek door levers, Modern Style Door Levers, solid brass door levers, passage levers, privacy levers, dummy levers, ada compliant levers"
